      "side": 1,
      "message": "The reason I\u0027m asking for this is that these tests are the only tests that the shader-injected validation is correct. We need to make sure that you cannot for example ask for a sampler entry on a texture entry (even if combined texture-sampler or w/e). While I agree that it is unlikely to be incorrect right now, it\u0027s still good to have exhaustive testing of validation like that to prevent regressions.\n\nI was suggesting `Undefined` that that\u0027s how `BindGroupLayoutEntry` does the sum-type (we cannot use union in the C header) and `std::variant` kinda sucks IMHO. But whatever makes the code look nice is fine :)",
